+scenarios through `DurableIndex.SyncFrom`: every N≤5 arrival order, sampled
+N=6 orders, duplicate replay, a later-filled gap, both timestamp orders, every
+proper peer-object subset, and one-to-three sync passes. An independent test
+oracle compares all six roots and the rebuilt projection; a same-identity,
+different-byte branch must return the typed conflict and persist quarantine.
+These checks add no sync command or advertised capability.
+
+This remains a library API. It is not wired into an `ax sync` command, the
+authenticated Host Channel handler, or a doctor/capability surface, and makes
+no network transport claim. Raw blob/chunk staging and destination
